[TITLE]
NUM-45: MASS-type pollutant loads at two junctions that never receive water.
J2 gets 10 mg/s and J3 100 mg/s of P1; neither has any flow inflow, so both
stay dry (depth 0, inflow 0) for the whole run.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         10
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J2      0     5         0          0         0
J3      0     5         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
O2   0   FREE
O3   0   FREE

[CONDUITS]
C2  J2   O2  400  0.013  0  0  0
C3  J3   O3  400  0.013  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C2  CIRCULAR  1  0  0  0  1
C3  CIRCULAR  1  0  0  0  1

[POLLUTANTS]
P1  MG/L  0  0  0  0  NO  *  0  0  0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node Param TimeSeries Type Mfactor Sfactor Baseline
J2  P1  ""  MASS  1.0  1.0  10
J3  P1  ""  MASS  1.0  1.0  100

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
